OL,3,ASupreme Court revives controversial US
OL,4,Adata system for citizenship checks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Supreme Court has lifted
OL,7,Frestrictions on the Trump
OL,8,Fadministration to use a controversial
OL,9,Ffederal database that uses citizenship
OL,10,Finformation and other sensitive data to
OL,11,Fidentify voters suspected of being
OL,12,Fnon-citizens.
OL,14,FCritics have questioned the reliability
OL,15,Fof the data, warning it could result in
OL,16,FUS citizens being wrongly removed from
OL,17,Felectoral rolls.
OL,19,FIn June, a federal judge ruled that the
OL,20,Fsystem was illegal and violated the
OL,21,Fprivacy rights of Americans.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
