OL,3,ASupreme Court revives controversial US
OL,4,Adata system for citizenship checks
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the top court's conservative
OL,7,Fmajority ruled that the National Voter
OL,8,FRegistration Act prohibits broad purges
OL,9,Fof voter rolls in the weeks before an
OL,10,Felection, which limits any "potential
OL,11,Fimpact" of the decision ahead of the
OL,12,Fmidterms.
